BT /T 10.0 Tf 88.00 544.10 Td (Preference-based post-training improves language models, but the standard methods use surface tokens as) Tj ET
BT /T 10.0 Tf 88.00 530.10 Td (the training signal and target high-resource languages. We present S?b?n, a post-training framework that) Tj ET
BT /T 10.0 Tf 88.00 516.10 Td (adds morphotactic verification to the alignment loop for small language models in extremely low-resource) Tj ET
BT /T 10.0 Tf 88.00 502.10 Td (languages. A rule-based morphological analyzer checks each generated analysis against a per-language) Tj ET
BT /T 10.0 Tf 88.00 488.10 Td (grammar and dictionary, and a morpheme-level reward turns the check into a training signal for supervised) Tj ET
BT /T 10.0 Tf 88.00 474.10 Td (fine-tuning, DPO, APO, and GRPO. The framework also gates automatic grammar and dictionary updates) Tj ET
BT /T 10.0 Tf 88.00 460.10 Td (behind an integrity threshold. We run S?b?n on the 13 national languages of Mali with five small models) Tj ET
BT /T 10.0 Tf 88.00 446.10 Td (from 135M to 2B parameters and report morphological integrity, morpheme error rate, consistency, and an) Tj ET
BT /T 10.0 Tf 88.00 432.10 Td (uncertainty-weighted cost on a seed-fixed held-out split. GRPO gives the lowest morpheme error rate for) Tj ET
BT /T 10.0 Tf 88.00 418.10 Td (SmolLM2-135M, Gemma-4-E2B, and TinyLlama-1.1B, while the four arms tie for LFM2.5-230M. We) Tj ET
BT /T 10.0 Tf 88.00 404.10 Td (record and seal every run with K-Veritas, so each reported score is bound to the computation that produced) Tj ET
BT /T 10.0 Tf 88.00 390.10 Td (it and can be verified publicly. We report the full configuration and evaluation records so that others can) Tj ET
